[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0713","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0713.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54619","title":"sqlite3-ruby SQLite3 Ruby 绑定释放后使用漏洞","description":"sqlite3-ruby 是 SQLite3 数据库的 Ruby 语言绑定库。在 2.9.4 及之前版本中，使用不同参数个数（arity）重新定义同名 SQLite 函数时，之前注册的函数处理器会被释放，但 SQLite 内部仍保留对该已释放内存的引用，从而触发释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过特定的函数重定义操作，在垃圾回收后引发程序崩溃或内存读取异常。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 2.0，危害等级低，建议升级至 v2.9.5 及以上版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54619","GHSA-28hh-pr2h-2w89"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-28T20:17:26Z","remediation":"升级 sqlite3 gem 至 v2.9.5 或更高版本：在 Gemfile 中将 `gem 'sqlite3'` 版本约束改为 `>= 2.9.5` 后执行 `bundle update sqlite3`。若无法升级，避免对同一函数名使用不同参数个数（arity）多次调用 `create_function` 或 `define_function`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sparklemotion/sqlite3-ruby/commit/2bd436d17f77cdd4c31b00fe9d50b0d21cbaf033","https://github.com/sparklemotion/sqlite3-ruby/pull/710","https://github.com/sparklemotion/sqlite3-ruby/releases/tag/v2.9.5","https://github.com/sparklemotion/sqlite3-ruby/security/advisories/GHSA-28hh-pr2h-2w89","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/a70bd29e2c7eb8c31312c2f14113c95ca94eedec/gems/sqlite3/CVE-2026-54619.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/8f7b95a77280c43fc7bace48967d8f636131c581/advisories/_posts/2026-06-07-CVE-2026-54619.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54619.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/gem/sqlite3/CVE-2026-54619.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54619.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0713.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0712","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0712.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54609","title":"QTI NeonRelay 未授权中继转发放大拒绝服务漏洞","description":"QTINeon（QTI Neon）是一款基于 UDP 中继的多人在线游戏协议库，其重连处理器（handleReconnectRequest）在处理 RECONNECT_REQUEST 数据包时，未对 pendingReconnects 映射表进行去重或大小限制，也未设置类似连接流程中的 maxPendingConnections 上限。未经身份认证的远程攻击者在知晓有效会话 ID 后，可从大量伪造源地址发送 RECONNECT_REQUEST 数据包；每个伪造源的请求均会通过会话查找并被转发至主机端，且每源速率限制器为每个伪造 IP 分配独立令牌桶，无法提供有效防护。在每次清理周期中，主机将收到每个伪造源的一个转发包，导致中继成为针对主机的放大拒绝服务（DoS）攻击向量。此外，当伪造 IP 数量超过 maxRateLimiters 阈值后，performCleanup 调用 rateLimiters.clear() 会重置所有源（含合法源）的速率限制状态，进一步加剧服务不可用。该漏洞影响 QTINeon v1.0.0 的 Java、Python、TypeScript 三种实现版本，CVSS 评分 8.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54609","GHSA-85rg-p3fr-xc2f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:22Z","remediation":"暂无官方修复版本，建议立即在三个实现（Java/Python/TypeScript）中对 handleReconnectRequest 应用三项代码修复：1) 在转发前检查 pendingReconnects 大小是否达到 maxPendingConnections，超限则拒绝；2) 仅当 sessionId:clientId 不在 pendingReconnects 中时才转发给主机，已存在则仅更新源地址；3) performCleanup 时优先驱逐被限流条目，避免 rateLimiters.clear() 重置合法客户端状态。网络层面部署 BCP38/uRPF 入站过滤，丢弃伪造源地址的 UDP 包，切断放大攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Quiet-Terminal-Interactive/QTINeon/security/advisories/GHSA-85rg-p3fr-xc2f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54609.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54609.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54609.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54609.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54609.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/npm/qti-neon/CVE-2026-54609.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/pypi/qti-neon/CVE-2026-54609.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/maven/com.quietterminal/qti-neon/CVE-2026-54609.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b42c08ef31b9369853f91fdded7aa2e7f5348a74/content/posts/cve-2026-54609.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/9e33c1ae12aecd0fae707eb39a2a5797a188cccb/api/2026/CVE-2026-54609.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0712.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0711","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0711.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54605","title":"Ruby OAuth 跨域重定向签名请求元信息泄露漏洞","description":"Ruby oauth 库在 1.1.6 之前版本中存在跨源重定向信息泄露漏洞。当应用使用 OAuth::Consumer 请求 OAuth 1.0 请求令牌或访问令牌时，token_request 方法会递归跟随 OAuth 服务器返回的 300..399 重定向。若重定向目标为不同主机但路径相同，该方法会解析原始 Location 头，修改消费者配置的 site 并重建 HTTP 客户端，随后继续向攻击者控制的主机发送已签名的令牌请求。攻击者因此可获取 OAuth 1.0 签名元数据，包括 oauth_consumer_key、oauth_signature_method、oauth_timestamp、oauth_nonce、oauth_version 及 oauth_signature 等敏感信息。此外，由于应用服务器以自身网络位置发起重定向后的请求，该漏洞还可被利用进行 SSRF（服务器端请求伪造）和混淆代理攻击。影响范围包括 oauth gem v0.5.5 至 v1.1.5 所有版本。修复方案为升级至 v1.1.6，该版本默认拒绝跨源令牌端点重定向，仅允许同源重定向并设置最大重定向次数限制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54605","GHSA-prq8-7wvh-44qh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:22Z","remediation":"升级到 oauth v1.1.6，该版本默认拒绝跨源令牌端点重定向。如无法立即升级，请确保 OAuth 令牌端点 URL 为固定绝对路径且不受租户控制，同时在网络层阻止应用服务器向外部元数据服务的出站访问，或在 OAuth 提供商前部署可信代理以拦截跨源重定向。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth/commit/d069dc8c4c9631947451215f07460d6cdf0caf3f","https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth/releases/tag/v1.1.6","https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth/security/advisories/GHSA-prq8-7wvh-44qh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/002f445c117788eccca176fc25679a0054ff81a3/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ab0d3409b603db1796a3b851a886f8cdf7b31ac5/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/de1ee663b3df0d1f1b578bbafc4a2ebfacf8048e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/de1ee663b3df0d1f1b578bbafc4a2ebfacf8048e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6ac8a9b890bb6406909f4f8a26f9c6dd683fab7d/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54605.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/gem/oauth/CVE-2026-54605.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54605","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/b14fd8ec04be4ff4368c21201cf29e70fa75527b/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54605/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0711.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0710","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0710.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54603","title":"Ruby oauth2 协议相对重定向导致Bearer令牌泄露漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Ruby oauth2 库（0.4.0 至 2.0.21 版本）的 OAuth2::Client#request 方法在处理 30x 重定向时，若 Location 头为协议相对地址（如 `//attacker.example/leak`），URI#merge 会按照 RFC 3986 §5.2 将其解析为网络路径引用并替换基础 URL 的 authority，同时递归重发请求时保留原始请求中由 OAuth2::AccessToken#configure_authentication! 注入的 Authorization: Bearer 令牌头，导致用户访问令牌被泄露至攻击者控制的服务器。该漏洞影响所有使用该库调用 OAuth2/OpenID Connect 资源接口的 Ruby 应用，攻击者可通过开放重定向、多租户部署中的恶意 IdP 或中间人篡改响应头等条件触发，无需用户二次交互即可在单跳重定向中窃取访问令牌，同时还可利用重定向对内网地址发起 SSRF 攻击。官方已在 2.0.22 版本修复该问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54603","GHSA-pp92-crg2-gfv9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-29T14:16:31Z","remediation":"立即将 oauth2 gem 升级到 v2.0.22 或更高版本，该版本已在 Client#request 中对协议相对型 Location 头添加 ./ 前缀处理以阻止跨域重定向。在升级前，可临时缓解：在应用层对 OAuth2::Client 的 redirect 回调进行封装，检测到 Location 以 // 开头时拒绝跟随或强制改为相对路径；同时配置 Faraday 适配器在跨域重定向时剥离 Authorization 请求头，降低凭证泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth2/commit/0f0a474f1b38453e119e660c2daca742d4378ce9","https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth2/releases/tag/v2.0.22","https://github.com/ruby-oauth/oauth2/security/advisories/GHSA-pp92-crg2-gfv9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/761c156ad3eda85b7d2b67fee400e658dfbee229/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/47ec74f5faf5543ca791f6a1af1c075a0176bd75/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/47ec74f5faf5543ca791f6a1af1c075a0176bd75/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54603.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/53f6046d6bc3edd16e076ae391d494ba7302fe9f/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54603.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/gem/oauth2/CVE-2026-54603.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54603"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0710.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0706","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0706.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54345","title":"GoPacket gopacket Diameter AVP 解码器整数下溢远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"gopacket 是 Go 语言的网络数据包处理库，版本 1.6.0 及更早版本中的 Diameter AVP 解码器存在整数下溢漏洞。该解码器在计算 AVP 数据长度时，直接执行 `dataLength := avp.Length - uint32(headerSize)` 运算，未在 Vendor 标志位被设置后校验 `avp.Length` 是否不小于 12 字节的扩展头部长度。当攻击者发送一个带有 Vendor 标志且 24 位 Length 字段值为 8、9、10 或 11 的恶意 Diameter AVP 时，该减法运算会发生 uint32 下溢，得到一个约 42.9 亿的值，并直接传递给 `make([]byte, dataLength)` 触发约 4 GiB 的未限制内存分配。攻击者只需通过 TCP 连接向运行 gopacket 的 Diameter 数据包采集器发送两个特制的 32 字节恶意 Diameter 消息，即可耗尽内存并触发 OOM-killer 终止进程，实现无需认证的远程拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用 gopacket Diameter 层解析网络数据包的服务，包括电信和 5G 信令监测系统。官方已在 v1.6.1 版本中通过在 Vendor 标志分支后增加 `avp.Length < headerSize` 校验修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54345","GHSA-6r28-9ppf-4hj5"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:21Z","remediation":"将 github.com/gopacket/gopacket 升级到 v1.6.1 或更高版本。官方补丁在 layers/diameter_avp_decoders.go 的 decodeDiameterAVP 函数中于计算 dataLength 前增加校验：若 avp.Length < uint32(headerSize)，则返回错误，防止 uint32 下溢驱动约 4 GiB 非受控内存分配。升级命令为：go get github.com/gopacket/gopacket@v1.6.1。若暂无法升级，可在防火墙或网络层过滤 Diameter 协议（TCP/SCTP 3868 端口）的不可信来源流量，阻止恶意 AVP 消息到达解析器，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/commit/145859d0eaee1a6f5925ffb93851c976449c3311","https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/releases/tag/v1.6.1","https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/security/advisories/GHSA-6r28-9ppf-4hj5","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4737a147a20cab10b00f750066e37f71a687da01/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54345.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3eeaeb834be138ec333241b53d2f3ecf4145ea0/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3eeaeb834be138ec333241b53d2f3ecf4145ea0/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-543xx/CVE-2026-54345.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/gopacket/gopacket/CVE-2026-54345.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-54345.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0706.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0705","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0705.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54332","title":"gopacket sFlow ExtendedGatewayFlow 解码器无界分配远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GoPacket 的 sFlow ExtendedGatewayFlow 解码器存在资源耗尽漏洞。攻击者通过发送一个仅 104 字节的 UDP sFlow 数据报即可触发漏洞，解码器在读取循环之前根据攻击者控制的 32 位 communitiesLength 字段执行 make([]uint32, n) 进行无上限内存分配，单次请求可导致最多 16 GiB 的内存分配，进而使解析进程因 OOM 终止。攻击无需身份认证，任何能向 sFlow 采集器发送 UDP 数据包的主机均可触发。该问题影响 gopacket v1.6.0 及之前版本，已于 v1.6.1 版本中通过在解码前增加边界检查修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54332","GHSA-g6v3-7xmc-w563"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T17:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:21Z","remediation":"立即将 github.com/gopacket/gopacket 升级至 v1.6.1 或更高版本，该版本已在 decodeExtendedGatewayFlowRecord 和 decodePath 中增加对 communitiesLength 与 ad.Count 的边界校验，在 make 分配前拒绝超出剩余字节数的非法计数字段。如无法立即升级，可在 sFlow 采集器前端部署网络过滤规则，丢弃源端口或长度异常的 UDP 6343 报文，限制单条 datagram 最大字节数以缓解攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/commit/76119086f5936aacd7088bdf97d565501bb6c4cc","https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/releases/tag/v1.6.1","https://github.com/gopacket/gopacket/security/advisories/GHSA-g6v3-7xmc-w563","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54332.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-543xx/CVE-2026-54332.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/gopacket/gopacket/CVE-2026-54332.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/be6cb1a6a44a9623de644275c61d54798195b4f5/content/posts/cve-2026-54332.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0705.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0889","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0889.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-61609","title":"Pterodactyl Panel 认证全局速率限制拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pterodactyl 游戏服务器管理面板 1.7.0 至 1.13.0 版本中存在认证速率限制缺陷，其 RouteServiceProvider::configureRateLimiting() 方法为登录和双因素认证端点配置的限流器使用了全局共享令牌桶，而非按 IP 或账户进行独立计数。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过单个 IP 每秒约发送 10 次请求（利用无 reCAPTCHA 保护的 /auth/login/checkpoint 端点成本最低），耗尽全局共享计数器，导致所有用户（包括管理员）的登录和双因素认证请求均返回 HTTP 429 错误，造成面板级认证拒绝服务。该攻击无需任何权限、无需用户交互，攻击者持续发包即可维持锁定状态，严重影响面板可用性。官方已在 1.13.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-61609","GHSA-xvc3-826v-xf47"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:19:28Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:29:19Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pterodactyl Panel 至 v1.13.0 或更高版本（https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/releases/tag/v1.13.0），该版本已为认证限流器添加按 IP 的独立计数。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（Nginx/Cloudflare）对 /auth/login 和 /auth/login/checkpoint 端点按来源 IP 设置频率限制（如每 IP 每分钟最多 30 次请求）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/commit/98079a01660a61980fe62a72b2c1d48f99c35a5e","https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/releases/tag/v1.13.0","https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/security/advisories/GHSA-xvc3-826v-xf47","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2026/CVE-2026-61609.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2026/61xxx/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2026/61xxx/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-616xx/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-61609.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-28/TIER_2_CVE-2026-61609.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0889.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0889.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0889.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0709","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54593","title":"Pterodactyl Wings JWT 验证失效导致的文件上传权限提升漏洞","description":"Pterodactyl 的 Wings 组件在 `/upload/file` 接口中存在 JWT 作用域验证不足的权限提升漏洞。由于 Wings 仅校验 JWT 是否包含 `server_uuid`、`user_uuid` 和 `unique_id` 等必要声明，而未验证该令牌的预期用途，导致攻击者可以将低权限操作（如 WebSocket 连接或文件下载）生成的 JWT 令牌复用于文件上传接口。只要攻击者拥有最低限度的子用户权限（如 `websocket.connect`），即可通过重放该令牌绕过 `file.create` 权限检查，从而在目标服务器上任意上传文件，导致服务器被非法篡改或执行远程代码。该漏洞影响 Panel 1.12.3 及 Wings 1.12.2 之前的版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54593","GHSA-8r6w-3qq5-4p4r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:19:00Z","updated":"2026-07-28T17:16:51Z","remediation":"建议将 Pterodactyl Panel 升级至 1.12.3 版本，并将 Wings 升级至 1.12.2 版本，以修复 JWT 范围验证不足导致的文件上传权限提升漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/commit/7ffcd636310bb72b54bac3280d2a15e727feded7","https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/pull/5636","https://github.com/pterodactyl/panel/security/advisories/GHSA-8r6w-3qq5-4p4r","https://github.com/pterodactyl/wings/commit/d0ddc80844479302abdaf9654de3bacd511c0f5c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54593.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54593.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54593.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54593.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54593.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-545xx/CVE-2026-54593.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/packagist/pterodactyl/panel/CVE-2026-54593.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/pterodactyl/wings/CVE-2026-54593.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/94ce1175ce243f0d16b7ce039a4aba234d892f4e/content/posts/cve-2026-54593.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/9e33c1ae12aecd0fae707eb39a2a5797a188cccb/api/2026/CVE-2026-54593.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0709.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0709.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0707","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0707.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54545","title":"wakaru @wakaru/cli 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"@wakaru/cli 命令行工具在处理 JavaScript bundle 解包（--unpack）时存在路径穿越漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对模块文件名的过滤机制不足，仅执行一次清理，导致包含重叠遍历字符（如 \"....//\"）的恶意文件名在过滤后仍能还原为 \"../\"，从而使输出路径逃逸出预设的目标目录。攻击者可通过诱导用户解包特制的恶意 bundle 文件，在目标系统上实现任意文件写入。根据目标路径和环境不同，此漏洞可能进一步导致远程代码执行。受影响版本为 1.0.0 至 1.4.0，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54545","GHSA-7wpj-vvmv-pgm8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:18:59Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:18:59Z","remediation":"建议立即将 @wakaru/cli 升级至 1.4.0 或最新版本，可通过运行 `npm install @wakaru/cli@latest` 完成更新。在无法立即升级的情况下，请停止对来源不可信或未知的 JavaScript bundle 使用 `--unpack` 参数以防止任意文件写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/pionxzh/wakaru/commit/1d30383b20a6f768786b8ada2f1b0945de13c316","https://github.com/pionxzh/wakaru/releases/tag/v1.4.0","https://github.com/pionxzh/wakaru/security/advisories/GHSA-7wpj-vvmv-pgm8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0c793543d13971808adc4cd275a6066082c6baa6/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9c7fdceacbf752d9226426b16b33039c75699d63/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3ff6beb83d6269b250baa3883409b203119d8277/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-545xx/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/npm/@wakaru/cli/CVE-2026-54545.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/8c0ac8c7522257dc9de4edeb2679bdcb4d52cca4/content/posts/cve-2026-54545.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/9c07393070c4774028819e409c1391a0e8a069cc/api/2026/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/38bbfc0e4dbab174849da18f25b4124bbc43e463/2026/CVE-2026-54545.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2026-54545.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0707.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0697","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0697.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47427","title":"GitHub MCP Server 空指针解引用拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GitHub MCP Server 在处理 `completion/complete` 请求时存在空指针解引用漏洞。由于 `CompletionsHandler` 函数在访问 `params.Ref` 之前未进行空值检查，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过发送缺失或为空的 `ref` 字段的畸形 JSON-RPC 请求，触发 Go 运行时恐慌（panic）并导致服务器进程崩溃。该漏洞影响 1.1.0 版本之前的所有版本，可被用于实施完整的拒绝服务（DoS）攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47427","GHSA-w4q6-qw23-4rg7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:18:14Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:20Z","remediation":"建议立即将 GitHub MCP Server 升级至 v1.1.0 或更高版本。该版本通过在 CompletionsHandler 函数中增加对 params.Ref 的 nil 检查，解决了空指针解引用导致的拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/commit/c88d2ecdd3bb07f7bdd75296e3ee676febf14f58","https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/pull/2502","https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/releases/tag/v1.1.0","https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/security/advisories/GHSA-w4q6-qw23-4rg7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c6687683c20a51e5966eace996edacb0ad359fbe/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fa3e4fb278ec61c3b5d12d00f5d27a2be50cbac6/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-47427.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-474xx/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9983d976fdefe17a33208860cbdc1688253b084f/content/posts/cve-2026-47427.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/github/github-mcp-server/CVE-2026-47427.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7bea0dcb5dee2f48877390a7bd4e855e990c4f7a/2026/CVE-2026-47427.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/a61093fe8784b8ca7275942dc1f03ea5da66b812/api/2026/CVE-2026-47427.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0697.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0697.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0697.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0695","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0695.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45293","title":"WordPress WordPressCS 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞源于 WordPress Coding Standards (WordPressCS) 中 `WordPress.WP.EnqueuedResourceParameters` 检查项的实现缺陷。在处理 `wp_enqueue_script()` 等函数的 `$ver` 参数时，其 `is_falsy()` 方法会将重建的参数通过 `eval()` 函数执行。攻击者可通过在恶意 PHP 代码中构造特殊的参数（如 `'system'('id')`），诱导使用 `WordPress` 或 `WordPress-Extra` 规则集的 PHPCS 扫描器执行。当开发人员在本地审查第三方代码或 CI 流水线自动对 PR 进行代码风格检查时，会导致扫描主机被远程执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 3.4.1 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45293","GHSA-3pwp-g2mj-5p3v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:18:13Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:18:13Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WordPress Coding Standards (WordPressCS) 升级至 3.4.1 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，可通过在自定义 ruleset 文件中添加 `<rule ref=\"WordPress\"><exclude name=\"WordPress.WP.EnqueuedResourceParameters\"/></rule>` 来禁用受影响的 sniff，从而缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress-Coding-Standards/commit/a29048d0bbef5cf25d42349c74e4072d3cbc8325","https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress-Coding-Standards/pull/2771","https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress-Coding-Standards/releases/tag/3.4.1","https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress-Coding-Standards/security/advisories/GHSA-3pwp-g2mj-5p3v","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2026/45xxx/CVE-2026-45293.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-45293.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-452xx/CVE-2026-45293.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9983d976fdefe17a33208860cbdc1688253b084f/content/posts/cve-2026-45293.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/a61093fe8784b8ca7275942dc1f03ea5da66b812/api/2026/CVE-2026-45293.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/850a5c12479fcc3145fda9fa79403efdef7fb609/2026/CVE-2026-45293.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2026-45293.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/67f6bd8a61451c9d084c4ce64f27a2de1d58822a/cve/CVE-2026-45293.html","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/af1c328f6ac2eacf9f8a1891593aabd84244fb34/docs/2026/WordPress_Coding_Standards_Eval注入漏洞_CVE-2026-45293.toml","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/3ac190453e0bcb92b4648f93645a278eabf8061d/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-45293.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0695.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0693","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0693.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43910","title":"Appium java-client directConnect 未验证重定向导致网络枢轴漏洞","description":"Appium Java Client 在 8.2.1 至 10.1.1 版本中存在输入验证漏洞。当客户端开启 `directConnect(true)` 模式时，`AppiumCommandExecutor.setDirectConnect()` 方法会无条件接受服务器在 `NEW_SESSION` 响应中返回的 `directConnectHost`、`directConnectPort` 及 `directConnectPath` 字段，且仅验证协议为 https，缺乏对主机名或 IP 的白名单校验。攻击者可通过构建恶意 Appium 服务器，在响应中注入伪造的重定向地址，诱导客户端将后续所有会话流量静默重定向至攻击者控制的端点。该漏洞可导致会话流量被完全拦截，或被利用进行服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）以探测内网主机，甚至窃取云平台实例元数据服务（IMDS）的凭据。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43910","GHSA-28f5-38xr-jh2w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T16:18:12Z","updated":"2026-07-28T18:17:20Z","remediation":"建议立即将 appium/java-client 升级至 v10.1.1 或更高版本。如果暂时无法升级，请在配置中将 directConnect 设置为 false，以禁用不安全的直接连接重定向功能，防止会话流量被劫持或触发内网请求伪造。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/appium/java-client/commit/2b9cd442b9dbf56ccc6f1e83aeeb411c0ec230c9","https://github.com/appium/java-client/pull/2408","https://github.com/appium/java-client/releases/tag/v10.1.1","https://github.com/appium/java-client/security/advisories/GHSA-28f5-38xr-jh2w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-439xx/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f7c7e24781311f0ffdff9c48a833d9f9836f1760/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-43910/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9983d976fdefe17a33208860cbdc1688253b084f/content/posts/cve-2026-43910.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8f9388ccf03511af7a94793190933c2b79f3688a/2026/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/a61093fe8784b8ca7275942dc1f03ea5da66b812/api/2026/CVE-2026-43910.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2026-43910.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/e21935e4d4564c5159567e79b8fd22be50287a12/cve/CVE-2026-43910.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0693.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0833","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0833.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59730","title":"Astro @astrojs/node 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Astro 框架的 @astrojs/node 独立服务器在配置 trailingSlash: 'always' 时，静态文件处理器对以 /\\（斜杠+反斜杠）开头的路径未正确识别为内部路径，导致 301 重定向时将原始路径直接回显到 Location 响应头中。由于浏览器遵循 WHATWG URL 规范将反斜杠视为正斜杠处理，攻击者可构造特制链接诱导用户点击，实现开放重定向至外部恶意站点。该漏洞影响 Astro 8.1.0 至 11.0.1 版本，需满足非默认配置 trailingSlash: 'always' 且请求路径末段无文件扩展名。Astro 11.0.2 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59730","GHSA-r557-wffq-wvrc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:17:16Z","remediation":"立即升级 @astrojs/node 至 11.0.2 或以上版本，该版本已修复反斜杠路径的内部路径识别问题。如无法升级，将 `trailingSlash` 配置改为默认值 `'ignore'`，避免静态文件处理器发出尾部斜杠重定向。同时可在反向代理层对 `Location` 响应头进行校验，过滤包含反斜杠或指向外部域名的重定向。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/eb6f97e391ee587747e37609c255c7cd4b9cce3c","https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17252","https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases/tag/@astrojs/node@11.0.2","https://github.com/withastro/astro/security/advisories/GHSA-r557-wffq-wvrc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/@astrojs/node/CVE-2026-59730.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59730.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59730.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0833.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0831","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0831.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59728","title":"Astro @astrojs/rss XML注入漏洞","description":"@astrojs/rss 组件中存在 XML 注入漏洞，由于 source.title 和 enclosure.type 字段在拼接 XML 模板字符串时未进行 XML 字符转义处理，直接交由 fast-xml-parser 解析。攻击者若能够控制 RSSFeedItem 中的这两个字段值（例如通过 CMS、数据库或用户提交内容），可注入任意 XML 元素到生成的 RSS 源中，包括伪造的 <link> 指向恶意 URL，破坏源结构并导致订阅者解析到攻击者控制的内容。在 SSR 模式下，被污染的 RSS 源会在每次请求时返回给所有订阅者。该漏洞影响 @astrojs/rss 1.0.0 至 4.0.18 版本，已在 4.0.19 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59728","GHSA-8j5q-mfj2-5q9q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:17:05Z","updated":"2026-07-28T16:17:16Z","remediation":"升级 @astrojs/rss 至 4.0.19 或更高版本：在项目根目录执行 `npm install @astrojs/rss@^4.0.19`。如无法立即升级，可在生成 RSSFeedItem 时对 `source.title` 和 `enclosure.type` 字段进行 XML 转义（如将 `<` 替换为 `&lt;`、`\"` 替换为 `&quot;`），或避免使用用户可控数据填充这两个字段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/fbcfa039dfe3d700b239f595a6c55ee35e45bd06","https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17209","https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases/tag/@astrojs/rss@4.0.19","https://github.com/withastro/astro/security/advisories/GHSA-8j5q-mfj2-5q9q","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/753d2e0d725b348a212e8863d776d632b54550eb/data/2026/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-597xx/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/npm/@astrojs/rss/CVE-2026-59728.yml","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59728.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/61334472876cf5ad32f3637a7727b548d9acebb5/content/posts/cve-2026-59728.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0831.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0831.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1028","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-43780","title":"Apple iOS 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Apple 多款操作系统存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），由于对纹理数据的输入验证不足，攻击者可构造恶意纹理文件诱导目标应用处理，触发整数溢出导致应用程序异常终止。该漏洞影响 iOS、iPadOS、macOS（Sequoia、Sonoma、Tahoe）、tvOS、visionOS 及 watchOS 等多个平台版本。攻击者需诱使用户打开或处理包含恶意构造纹理的文件，才能成功触发漏洞，造成拒绝服务。Apple 已在 iOS 26.6、iPadOS 26.6、macOS Sequoia 15.7.8、macOS Sonoma 14.8.8、macOS Tahoe 26.6、tvOS 26.6、visionOS 26.6 及 watchOS 26.6 中修复该问题，建议用户及时更新至安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-43780"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-27T21:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-28T19:44:50Z","remediation":"建议立即将 iOS/iPadOS 升级至 26.6，macOS Sequoia 升级至 15.7.8，macOS Sonoma 升级至 14.8.8，macOS Tahoe 升级至 26.6，tvOS 升级至 26.6，visionOS 升级至 26.6，watchOS 升级至 26.6。可通过\"设置\">\"通用\">\"软件更新\"路径或 App Store 自动安装系统更新。如暂时无法升级，应避免打开来源不明的图片或纹理文件，并限制 untrusted 应用访问 ImageIO 框架。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/128066","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128067","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128068","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128069","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128070","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128071","https://support.apple.com/en-us/128072","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2026/43xxx/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-437xx/CVE-2026-43780.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-43780.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/iOS/High/CVE-2026-43780.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/tvOS/High/CVE-2026-43780.md","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/c7a6c72786570796bbf00a5a5e7e3e822a87c483/content/macOS/High/CVE-2026-43780.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1028.toml"}]